---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { strings } from '../../i18n/strings';
const t = strings.en;
---
<BaseLayout lang="en" title={`Cookie Policy | ${t.brand}`} description="What cookies nevnap.app uses and how to manage them." altLangPath="/cookies">
  <article class="container mx-auto px-6 max-w-3xl pt-3 lg:pt-10">
    <nav class="nx-crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <ol><li><a href="/en/">{t.brand}</a></li><li aria-hidden="true">›</li><li aria-current="page">Cookie Policy</li></ol>
    </nav>
    <h1 class="mt-6 nx-page-title nx-page-title--sm nx-rise">Cookie Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-nx-subtle">Last updated: July 18, 2026.</p>

    <section class="mt-10 space-y-6 text-nx-muted leading-relaxed">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-nx-ink">What is a cookie?</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">A cookie is a small text file your browser stores from visited websites. Cookies help the site remember you, your settings, and create traffic statistics.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-nx-ink">What cookies we use</h2>

        <div class="mt-4 rounded-2xl border border-nx-line2 p-5">
          <h3 class="font-bold flex items-center gap-2.5"><span class="size-2.5 shrink-0 rounded-full" style="background:#2ea86b" aria-hidden="true"></span>Local preferences (always available)</h3>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm">These values use browser localStorage, rather than traditional cookies, to remember the theme and privacy choice.</p>
          <table class="mt-3 w-full text-xs">
            <thead class="text-left text-nx-subtle"><tr><th class="py-1 pr-3">Name</th><th class="py-1 pr-3">Purpose</th><th class="py-1">Lifespan</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr class="border-t border-nx-line"><td class="py-1 pr-3">nevnap-theme</td><td class="py-1 pr-3">Theme (dark/light)</td><td class="py-1">Until changed or cleared</td></tr>
              <tr class="border-t border-nx-line"><td class="py-1 pr-3">nevnap-consent</td><td class="py-1 pr-3">Cookie consent</td><td class="py-1">Until changed or cleared</td></tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-4 rounded-2xl border border-nx-line2 p-5">
          <h3 class="font-bold flex items-center gap-2.5"><span class="size-2.5 shrink-0 rounded-full" style="background:#4a8cff" aria-hidden="true"></span>Analytics (with consent)</h3>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm">Anonymous traffic statistics. Does not identify you personally.</p>
          <table class="mt-3 w-full text-xs">
            <thead class="text-left text-nx-subtle"><tr><th class="py-1 pr-3">Name</th><th class="py-1 pr-3">Provider</th><th class="py-1">Lifespan</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr class="border-t border-nx-line"><td class="py-1 pr-3">_ga, _ga_*</td><td class="py-1 pr-3">Google Analytics 4</td><td class="py-1">14 mo</td></tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-4 rounded-2xl border border-nx-line2 p-5">
          <h3 class="font-bold flex items-center gap-2.5"><span class="size-2.5 shrink-0 rounded-full" style="background:#ff9d3c" aria-hidden="true"></span>Advertising and consent technologies</h3>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm">Google AdSense code may run on edited publisher-content pages. Google's consent framework may use cookies such as <code>FCCDCF</code> or <code>FCNEC</code>; approved ad serving may also use <code>__gads</code> or <code>__gpi</code>. The exact set depends on region, consent and Google configuration.</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm">In the EEA, advertising consent is handled separately by a Google-certified CMP; this site's own cookie banner controls analytics only. Until that certified message is active, ad storage is denied by default through Google Consent Mode. See <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/cookies" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-nx-accent underline">Google's cookie information</a>.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-nx-ink">Managing your cookie preferences</h2>
        <ul class="mt-2 list-disc list-inside space-y-1">
          <li><button type="button" id="reopen-banner" class="text-nx-accent underline">Reopen cookie banner</button></li>
          <li>Your browser settings</li>
          <li>Google Analytics opt-out: <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-nx-accent underline">tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout</a></li>
          <li>Google ad settings: <a href="https://myadcenter.google.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-nx-accent underline">My Ad Center</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-nx-ink">More info</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">See the full <a href="/en/privacy" class="text-nx-accent underline">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>
  <script is:inline>
    document.getElementById('reopen-banner')?.addEventListener('click', function () {
      if (window.nevnapConsent?.reopen) window.nevnapConsent.reopen();
    });
  </script>
</BaseLayout>
